BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Story time Series Comic & Picture Book Alumni Artist Panel Discuss
 ion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T183000
UID:dorothy-h-hoover-library-x-illu-present-story-time-series-comic-pictur
 e-book@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we mark an incredible 150 years of illustration at 
 OCADU! Together with the Dorothy H. Hoover Library\, the Illustration prog
 ram invites our notable\, award-winning alumni illustrators to share insig
 hts into the world of sequential illustration with the OCAD University com
 munity.\n\nJoin us as we mark an incredible 150 years of illustration at O
 CADU! Together with the Dorothy H. Hoover Library\, the Illustration progr
 am invites our notable\, award-winning alumni illustrators\, the Fan Broth
 ers (Eric Fan and Terry Fan)\, Rosena Fung \, and Sid Sharp \, as they sha
 re insights into the world of sequential illustration with the OCAD Univer
 sity community. Moderated by Assistant Professor Suharu Ogawa \, they will
  share memorable moments from their student years\, their career paths\, i
 nspiration\, and what it means to be a storyteller today and in the future
 . The event will be followed by the Halloween Student Social\, supported b
 y the Faculty of Design. Event organizer & contact: Assistant Professor\, 
 Suharu Ogawa sogawa@ocadu.ca Donate to the Illustration Program Initiative
  Fund today! Your generosity is greatly appreciated.
LOCATION:Learning Zone 113 McCaul Street Room 110\, Level 1
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/dorothy-h-hoover-library-x
 -illu-present-story-time-series-comic-picture-book
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
