BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:One-on-One Career Mentorship with Will Selviz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261020T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261217T160000
UID:one-one-career-mentorship-will-selviz@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Looking for some feedback on your work\, career path\, or life
  after OCAD U? The OCAD U Creative Professionals-In-Residence program is a
  mentorship initiative created to support the career success of current OC
 AD U students and recent alumni. Book a one-on-one career mentorship sessi
 on with our guests this semester and receive career advising\, feedback on
  your portfolio and hear their professional insights.\n\nIntroducing our F
 all 2026 Creative Professional-in-Residence\, Will Selviz (Multidisciplina
 ry Designer & Founder of RENDRD Media )! Looking for some feedback on your
  work\, career path\, or life after OCAD U? The OCAD U Creative Profession
 als-In-Residence program is a mentorship initiative created to support the
  career success of current OCAD U students and recent alumni. Book a one-o
 n-one career mentorship session with our guest this semester and receive c
 areer advising\, feedback on your portfolio and hear their professional in
 sights. Venezuelan-born Will Selviz is a trailblazer in immersive media an
 d experiential design. His diverse upbringing across Latin America\, the M
 iddle East\, and Canada fuels his innovative approach to digital storytell
 ing. A Clio Award winner and SXSW XR director\, Will seamlessly blends tra
 ditional and cutting-edge technologies. He is the founder of RENDRD Media\
 , an animation production and AI consultancy studio (currently the in-hous
 e agency for MLSE)\, and co-founder of Protopica\, a project focused on pr
 eserving culture through AI and spatial computing with collaborations incl
 uding Adobe\, OpenAI\, and Meta. Will also works as an Forward Deployed Cr
 eative for Magnific (formerly Freepik). Passionate about neuroscience and 
 Brain-Computer Interface (BCI) technology\, he aims to fuse creativity wit
 h scientific rigor\, crafting inclusive experiences that foster a sense of
  belonging. Website Instagram LinkedIn One-on-One Career Mentorship with W
 ill Selviz - Multidisciplinary Designer & Founder of RENDRD Media You can 
 book an in-person or virtual mentorship session with Will from October 20 
 - December 17\, 2026. Book an IN-PERSON session Book a VIRTUAL session
LOCATION:Rosalie Sharp Pavillion (MCD) 115 McCaul St. Level 3 (Virtual opt
 ions available)
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/one-one-career-mentorship-
 will-selviz
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
